      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.47,
      "end_seconds": 20.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "well, I've been having sudden confusion over a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.78,
      "end_seconds": 24.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.07,
      "end_seconds": 28.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.61,
      "end_seconds": 40.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.01,
      "end_seconds": 68.76,
      "duration_seconds": 26.75,
      "text": "I'd say five days actually, um, no, closer to three days i've also had not knowing where she is, for three days um, as for seeing things that aren't there, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.99,
      "end_seconds": 89.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "And what about fall or weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.43,
      "end_seconds": 95.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, none that that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.72,
      "end_seconds": 99.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "have you noticed chest pain or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.58,
      "end_seconds": 103.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Actually, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.84,
      "end_seconds": 107.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.92,
      "end_seconds": 112.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.77,
      "end_seconds": 116.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.24,
      "end_seconds": 122.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I mean my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.07,
      "end_seconds": 128.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.64,
      "end_seconds": 136.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "High blood pressure for nearly five years i've had arthritis in my knees yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.08,
      "end_seconds": 141.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.23,
      "end_seconds": 146.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.74,
      "end_seconds": 149.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.6,
      "end_seconds": 154.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.19,
      "end_seconds": 158.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Alright, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.27,
      "end_seconds": 165.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.97,
      "end_seconds": 169.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.96,
      "end_seconds": 173.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 174.66,
      "end_seconds": 185.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier. Oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 92. Temperature is 38.2 degrees, BP is 122 over 66, respiratory rate 21."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.7,
      "end_seconds": 186.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.76,
      "end_seconds": 194.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.88,
      "end_seconds": 196.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.41,
      "end_seconds": 215.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "She is drowsy, hot, disoriented and and her blood pressure is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.74,
      "end_seconds": 230.94,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with delirium from an infection. I can't rule out dehydration yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.84,
      "end_seconds": 239.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.57,
      "end_seconds": 261.59,
      "duration_seconds": 21.02,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's delirium from an infection and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had sudden confusion over a day for three days and no chest pain or fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.51,
      "end_seconds": 266.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "mm, that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.33,
      "end_seconds": 281.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I'm sending you for blood tests cos of delirium."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.01,
      "end_seconds": 284.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.26,
      "end_seconds": 307.9,
      "duration_seconds": 21.64,
      "text": "let's book a chest X-ray to look into fever and confusion she needs to go to hospital today for fluids and antibiotics i think the emergency team should see you too please don't wait if the symptoms get worse that's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.64,
      "end_seconds": 312.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Well okay I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.02,
      "end_seconds": 315.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.07,
      "end_seconds": 320.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Um, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
